message.content:
{"diagnosis": "Failing signal is TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 with tohost FAIL 0xdead vs expected advancing fetch through 256-word NOP mem. mem_do_rinst never issues so max_addr stays zero. Root cause at picorv32.v:1953 where mem_do_wdata <= 1 on (!resetn || mem_done) instead of <= 0, jamming the memory control and blocking fetches; CONE_SLICE empty so trace wins.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1949,6 +1949,6 @@
 		if (!resetn || mem_done) begin
 			mem_do_prefetch <= 0;
 			mem_do_rinst <= 0;
 			mem_do_rdata <= 0;
-			mem_do_wdata <= 1;
+			mem_do_wdata <= 0;
 		end", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), no TRAP: no progress, max_addr > 0x00000000 with fetch progress"}

